- Fix Method: Change line 49 from [module.replicator.identity] to [module.replicator.azapi_header.identity] and change condition from can() to != null check
- Changes Made: 
  * Line 49: Changed for_each = can(module.replicator.azapi_header.identity) ? [module.replicator.identity] : []
             to for_each = module.replicator.azapi_header.identity != null ? [module.replicator.azapi_header.identity] : []
